  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 116,
  "text_len": 17
 },
 {
  "id": "sce056:00089",
  "jp": "オズヴァルド「クルルちゃん‥‥おじさんを困らせないでおくれ{nl}　‥‥できるだけ君を傷つけたくないんだよぉ。{nl}　だって‥‥くくくくくく」",
  "off": 137,
  "len": 78,
  "en": "Oswald: Kururu-chan... Don't give this old man such a hard time... I really don't want to hurt you if I can help it. Because... kukukukukuku.",
